        "id": "3720b",
        "name": "[TMM Pack] AJR - Inertia [V3]",
        "description": "**Part of The Maybe Man Pack! https://beatsaver.com/playlists/309406**\nInertia is the 5th song on AJR's brand new album called The Maybe Man, released on November 10th, 2023.\n==========\n\nThis might be my new favorite AJR song. I took me some more time than usual to map this, because it's my favorite song on the album and I wanted it to be good. Hope you enjoy!\n\nThanks to the following people for helping out with this map:\n@Mario101: V3 Lights\n@Scorefam: Expert mapping\n\n*This map includes Arcs and Chains and uses the Panic 2.0 environment, and requires Beat Saber v1.29 or later to play!*\n\n**If you wanna get notified when I upload new maps, make sure to press the Follow button on my profile :)**\n\nExpert+ gameplay: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jHQtYh1mCV0&list=PL8LjUwMVe5QRlMPU4qPUKqfXepi3-TOuO&index=6\nExpert gameplay: https://youtu.be/7phqjrfOIfc?si=PSTjC-ZDscr5keXG\n\nThanks to @Duddzy, @TinkerVr85, @Scorefam and @BanditByTheStreet for testplaying!",
