        "name": "[Love Live! Birthday Pack] Eutopia - Lanzhu Zhong",
        "description": "Love Live! Birthday Pack - https://beatsaver.com/playlists/268749\n\nPLS PLAY ON 1.34.5. Lightshow will not be visible on anything below 1.33!!!\n\nMap is best played with \"All Effects\" turned on!\n\nMap Preview- soon\nZen Mode Preview- https://youtu.be/bYIyM9qdBGQ\nSong Sauce- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hk8lDW8JB5c\n\nMap will not work on 1.20 (OST 5) or below! Song uses Rolling Stones Environment (v1.33), and uses new easings which will only work on 1.34. Recommended play version is 1.34.2  (modded) or 1.34.5 (unmodded) on PC, or 1.28 on Quest.\n\nIf you cant vote, be sure to leave a review on BeastSaber or BeatSaver!\n\nEnvironment- Rolling Stones\n\nFULLY mapped and lit beatmap using beat saber's official 3D editor!\n\nAny issues, hit me up @FeudBoy_YT#6701",
