        "description": "Feels good to map a song that actually seems like it was meant for a rhythm game for once. I wanted to map this for a very long time, but I wanted to wait until I knew I could make this map interesting and do the song justice. More of those coming:)\n\nEx+ has techy,  groovy doubles, dancy walls and all the other fun stuff!\nThanks to Big_Ol_Dumpling for lights!\nReup: forgot lights in hard💀 (ty RateGyro)\n\nFeedback: Davaayy#8766",
