        "name": "namigroove - Zunda Shaking (feat. Zundamon & Kasukabe Tsumugi)",
        "description": "🚨 BACK TO MY SILLY SLOW TECH SHENANIGANS 🚨\n\nif you're playing with lights don't forget to use the environment: FitBeat \n(never lighting fitbeat again i don't like the ring zoom and it limits brightness WHY!?!?) - lights look BRIGHT in arcviewer but in game it's normal\n\nlawless might be kinda scary but i feel it flows better than my old lawless maps\nboth standard diffs are tech but nothing too crazy \nthis song is catchy but OMG its also annoying it's truly quite the combo\nthis map does have bpm changes it ranges from 140-200\n\nif you like the map or want to share any feedback let me know down below or through my discord | notvoidless\n\ncheck out namigroove here!!!\nhttps://soundcloud.com/namigroove\n\nGLHF!!!",
