        "name": "Far Too Loud - Firestorm",
        "description": "the long awaited\nmapped in 2024 (though have attempted a couple times since 2022) and tweaked/polished more recently, this is honestly one of my most fun maps. hope y'all aren't tired of dot jumps and anti-lean walls lmao\n\nyes i apologize for the abrupt ending but the outro was so long and monotonous that i just had to cut it, for my own sanity, and probably yours too. don't let that dissuade you from playing the map though cause every second of what's remaining is banger. if it's a problem for curation i can painstakingly add it back. and yea i know i undermapped the piano, iss intentional\n\nthanks to @ben208 and @TheBlackParrot for playtests!\nlightshow: https://youtu.be/O90l2ANbG9s",
