        "id": "4e0f1",
        "name": "ellis - back to life",
        "description": "It's been a while now, hasn't it? That's alright. \n\nWe're back with an ellis chart! Vex had this in his wips for a while and I stole it from him >:3\n\nEerie: All diffs aside from Vexpert Plus\nAvexus: Take a guess :3\n\n(P.S. It's my first time making a \"full\" spread so I'm sorry if it's too difficult still!)\n\nThank you, Barnotek for giving us lights! We all know that I wasn't gonna make them xD\n\nThe full Ellis - Signals EP is now out on beatsaver!\n#4e3b6 | ellis & Throttle - the stars\n#4e0f1 | ellis, NOVODOR, & Hayley May - back to life <-- (you are here)\n#51d78 | ellis - promises",
